[{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0064","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0064.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1318","title":"Samba 缓冲区溢出远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Samba 2.2.2 至 2.2.6 版本存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程攻击者可通过发送特制的加密密码触发该漏洞。在服务端解密过程中，将 DOS 代码页字符串转换为小端 UCS2 Unicode 字符串时发生缓冲区溢出，导致拒绝服务或任意代码执行。攻击者无需身份认证即可远程利用，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重。受影响系统需升级至 Samba 2.2.7 或更高版本。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1318"],"sources":["osv"],"published":"2002-12-11T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:59:06.367","remediation":"立即升级 Samba 至 2.2.7 或更高版本。对于 Debian Woody (3.0) 用户，安装 DSA-200 提供的 samba 2.2.3a-12 更新包。如无法升级，可应用官方补丁：修改 source/libsmb/smbencrypt.c 中 dos_struni2 调用的长度参数，将第 66 行的 256 改为变量 len。临时缓解措施：在 smb.conf 中禁用加密密码变更请求（设置 encrypt passwords = no），但此操作会降低安全性，仅作为临时方案。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000550","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=103801986818076&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=103859045302448&w=2","http://sunsolve.sun.com/pub-cgi/retrieve.pl?doc=fsalert/53580","http://us1.samba.org/samba/whatsnew/samba-2.2.7.html","http://www.ciac.org/ciac/bulletins/n-019.shtml","http://www.ciac.org/ciac/bulletins/n-023.shtml","http://www.debian.org/security/2002/dsa-200","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/958321","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/2002/MDKSA-2002-081.php","http://www.novell.com/linux/security/advisories/2002_045_samba.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-266.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/6210","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/10683","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A1467","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2002/CVE-2002-1318.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/97700d7e657426c8e1ee6cf44a0a2b88c60738c3/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1318.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-li