口读取任意文件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=103794021013436&w=2","http://www.debian.org/security/2002/dsa-197","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/10643.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/6189","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/97700d7e657426c8e1ee6cf44a0a2b88c60738c3/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1311.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1311","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2002-1311.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/800f04b3cfadd1b9ab0343f5b9acd785dbc1e953/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1311.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d8c03b84658bbca948e09e4af723cb11141fb41e/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-j8m5-3p5x-jmxf/GHSA-j8m5-3p5x-jmxf.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/debian_DSA-197.nasl","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-1311.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_149500_149600.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--f267334f-30b2-4ff5-8b43-c08c4b8f4279.json","https://github.com/jbeasl7/openvas-feed-sync-local/blob/0ca27158e3313c25f9fa1fe358be43c227fdedbe/openvas-feeds/vt-feed/nasl/2008/debian/deb_197.nasl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0062.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0061","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0061.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1307","title":"MHonArc 2.5.12 及之前版本 MIME 邮件头跨站脚本漏洞","description":"MHonArc 2.5.12 及更早版本中存在跨站脚本（XSS）漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向目标用户发送包含恶意脚本代码的 MIME 头名称的电子邮件，当 MHonArc 将邮件归档转换为 HTML 页面时，未对 MIME 头名称进行充分过滤和转义，导致恶意脚本在用户浏览器中执行。成功利用该漏洞可窃取用户会话 Cookie、劫持会话或进行钓鱼攻击。攻击者无需身份认证，仅需诱使用户访问包含恶意邮件的归档页面即可触发。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.8,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1307"],"sources":["osv"],"published":"2002-11-29T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:59:05.180","remediation":"升级 MHonArc 至 2.5.13 或更高版本（2.5.13 已修复 MIME 头部 XSS 过滤缺陷）。Debian 用户可通过 DSA-199 安全公告更新至 2.5.2-1.2（woody）或 2.5.13-1（unstable）。如无法升级，可在 MHonArc 配置中启用 `MIMEFILTERS` 指令对邮件 MIME 头部进行 HTML 实体编码过滤，阻止恶意脚本注入。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.debian.org/security/2002/dsa-199","http://www.mhonarc.org/archive/cgi-bin/mesg.cgi?a=mhonarc-users&i=200210211713.g9LHDXE02256%40mcguire.earlhood.com","http://www.osvdb.org/7353","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/6204","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/10666","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/22026","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/97700d7e657426c8e1ee6cf44a0a2b88c60738c3/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1307.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1307","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2002-1307.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/800f04b3cfadd1b9ab0343f5b9acd785dbc1e953/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1307.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d8c03b84658bbca948e09e4af723cb11141fb41e/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-4ghg-jxgx-f5gm/GHSA-4ghg-jxgx-f5gm.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/debian_DSA-199.nasl","https://github.com/debiancn/debian.org/blob/6abc98daa6356b20e410013a6920b3764af682d4/english/security/2002/dsa-199.data","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_149500_149600.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-1307.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--d0a406a9-87cf-4f6f-8658-1bddc6400741.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2002/POC-AVE-2002-0061.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0061.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0060","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0060.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1277","title":"Window Maker 图像文件处理缓冲区溢出远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Window Maker（wmaker）0.80.0 及更早版本中存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。当程序处理特制图像文件时，未能正确使用图像的宽度和高度信息来分配缓冲区，导致栈缓冲区溢出。远程攻击者可通过诱导用户打开恶意图像文件触发该漏洞，从而在目标系统上执行任意代码。该漏洞影响使用 Window Maker 窗口管理器的 Linux/Unix 系统，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1277"],"sources":["osv"],"published":"2002-11-12T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:59:02.697","remediation":"升级 Window Maker 至 0.80.1 或更高版本。Debian 系统请更新至 wmaker 0.80.0-4.1（DSA-190），Red Hat 系统请安装 RHSA-2003-009 提供的更新包，Mandrake 系统请应用 MDKSA-2002:085 补丁。如无法立即升级，避免使用 Window Maker 打开来自不可信来源的图片文件，或临时切换至其他窗口管理器。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000548","http://www.debian.org/security/2002/dsa-190","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/10560.php","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/2002/MDKSA-2002-085.php","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-009.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-043.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/6119","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/97700d7e657426c8e1ee6cf44a0a2b88c60738c3/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1277.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-