r 配置将默认 mailer 从 mailx 改为 sendmail 等更安全的程序，并在邮件发送前对邮件正文进行转义过滤，防止特殊字符被 mailx 解释执行。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=103659723101369&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=103679569705086&w=2","http://www.debian.org/security/2003/dsa-386","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/10548.php","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/2002/MDKSA-2002-076.php","http://www.novell.com/linux/security/advisories/2002_041_perl_mailtools.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/6104","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/97700d7e657426c8e1ee6cf44a0a2b88c60738c3/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1271.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1271","https://github.com/CPAN-Security/cpan-advisory-database/blob/bc9ed2336eeed09f48acb0a64fd37970dc5a31d6/triage/CVE-2002-1271.yml","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2002-1271.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f0111a41156462d46f484c055bdeafa69cf38c8e/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1271.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d8c03b84658bbca948e09e4af723cb11141fb41e/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-fm5h-r4qh-85fh/GHSA-fm5h-r4qh-85fh.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/mandrake_MDKSA-2002-076.nasl","https://github.com/briandfoy/cpan-security-advisory/blob/2089ff7201b44e5e462742a5baaa080ba003d257/cpansa/CPANSA-Mail-Mailer.yml","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/D/debian_DSA-386.nasl","https://github.com/debiancn/debian.org/blob/6abc98daa6356b20e410013a6920b3764af682d4/english/security/2003/dsa-386.data"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0058.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0059","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0059.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1275","title":"LPRNG html2ps 1.0 远程命令执行漏洞","description":"LPRng 打印系统中的 html2ps HTML/PostScript 转换器 1.0 版本存在远程命令执行漏洞。html2ps 在处理 HTML 文件中的 IMG 标签时，未对用户输入进行有效过滤，直接调用 Perl 的 open() 函数打开文件，导致攻击者可通过构造包含恶意管道命令（如 `|` 符号）的 IMG SRC 属性的 HTML 文件，在打印作业处理过程中以 lp 用户权限执行任意系统命令。攻击者需已获得 lp 账户访问权限，但成功利用后可获得 lp 用户权限的远程 shell，进而可能提升权限控制整个系统。该漏洞 CVSS v2 评分为 7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1275"],"sources":["osv"],"published":"2002-11-12","updated":"2002-11-12","remediation":"将 html2ps 升级至 1.0b3-1.1 或更高版本（Debian 用户可通过 DSA-192 更新）。该漏洞源于 html2ps 在处理 HTML 中 IMG 标签的 SRC 属性时未对用户输入进行过滤，直接传递给 Perl 的 open() 函数导致命令注入。建议同时限制 lp 账户的打印作业来源，仅允许受信任用户提交打印任务，并在 lpd 配置中禁用不必要的远程打印功能作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21974","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/97700d7e657426c8e1ee6cf44a0a2b88c60738c3/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1275.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1275","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2002-1275.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f0111a41156462d46f484c055bdeafa69cf38c8e/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1275.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/debian_DSA-192.nasl","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d8c03b84658bbca948e09e4af723cb11141fb41e/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-x9x9-cfm2-jg93/GHSA-x9x9-cfm2-jg93.json","https://github.com/debiancn/debian.org/blob/6abc98daa6356b20e410013a6920b3764af682d4/english/security/2002/dsa-192.data","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--ef262b01-5d49-4737-b95f-495ec931355d.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-1275.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_0.list.dict"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0059.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0057","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0057.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1235","title":"MIT KTH Kerberos 缓冲区溢出远程代码执行漏洞","description":"MIT Kerberos 5 (krb5-1.2.6及更早版本)、KTH Kerberos 4 (eBones 1.2.1之前版本) 以及启用 Kerberos 4 支持的 KTH Kerberos 5 (Heimdal 0.5.1之前版本) 中的 kadm_ser_in 函数存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。该函数未正确验证请求的长度字段，导致未经身份认证的远程攻击者可发送特制的恶意请求，触发缓冲区溢出并在目标系统上执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 Kerberos 认证服务的核心管理守护进程，CVSS 评分 10.0 (AV:N/AC:L/Au:N/C:C/I:C/A:C)，危害等级为严重。攻击者无需认证即可远程利用，完全控制受影响系统。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1235"],"sources":["osv"],"published":"2002-11-04T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:58:59.010","remediation":"升级 MIT Kerberos 5 到 1.2.7 或更高版本，KTH Kerberos 4 升级到 1.2.2 或更高版本，KTH Kerberos 5 升级到 0.5.2 或更高版本。如无法立即升级，建议禁用 kadmind 服务并配置防火墙仅允许内部网络访问，禁用所有明文协议认证，并强制使用强密码策略。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2002-10/0399.html","http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000534","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=103539530729206&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=103564944215101&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=103582517126392&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=103582805330339&w=2","http://web.mit.edu/kerberos/www/advisories/2002-002-kadm4_attacksig.txt","http://web.mit.edu/kerberos/www/advisories/MITKRB5-SA-2002-002-kadm4.txt","http://www.cert.org/advisories/CA-2002-29.html","http://www.debian.org/security/2002/dsa-183","http://www.debian.org/security/2002/dsa-184","http://www.debian.org/security/2002/dsa-185","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/10430.php","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/875073","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/2002/MDKSA-2002-073.php","http://www.pdc.kth.se/heimdal/","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-242.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/6024","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/60bbc98c39201e6f5661b9e41f1492ce39335948/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1235.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1235","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2002-1235.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f0111a41156462d46f484c055bdeafa69cf38c8e/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1235.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d8c03b84658bbca948e09e4af723cb11141fb41e/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-r4jv-xp6w-68qp/GHSA-r4jv-xp6w-68qp.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/redhat-RHSA-2002-250.nasl","https://github.com/zercurity/vulnerabilities/blob/8eb5f158d91688a46557263c708774d5f8d3956c/2002/CVE-2002-1235","https://github.com/jdkoftinoff/mb-linux-msli/blob/8adb103e34af9ff1d8d122e9ee2a1808836f0a14/uClinux-dist/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/redhat-RHSA-2003-021.nasl","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cwe_details/cwe_details_700_800.json","https://github.com/Team-Atlanta/aixcc-asc-atlantis/blob/785c446f980e12155935db586aa30c3b54adcc86/crs/src/crs-patch/smith/smith/lib/cwe/raw/CWE-130.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0057.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0056","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0056.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1232","title":"Linux NIS ypserv 内存泄漏拒绝服务漏洞","description":"NIS 软件包中的 ypserv 服务（版本 2.5 之前）的 yp_db.c 文件中的 ypdb_open 函数存在内存泄漏漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向目标系统发送大量针对不存在映射表的请求，触发该函数的内存泄漏，导致系统内存资源被持续消耗，最终造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 NIS Package 3.9 及更早版本，攻击无需身份认证，网络可达即可触发。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1232"],"sources":["osv"],"published":"2002-11-04T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:58:58.737","remediation":"将 ypserv（NIS 服务器）升级至 2.5 或更高版本。Red Hat Advanced Server 2.1 用户安装 RHSA-2002:224 提供的更新包（rpm -Fvh *.rpm），Debian 用户安装 DSA-180 提供的更新包。如无法升级，在防火墙层面限制对 ypserv 端口（TCP/UDP 111 及 834-847）的访问，仅允许受信任的 NIS 客户端连接。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000539","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=103582692228894&w=2","http://online.securityfocus.com/advisories/4605","http://www.debian.org/security/2002/dsa-180","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/10423.php","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/2002/MDKSA-2002-078.php","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-223.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-224.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-229.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/6016","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/60bbc98c39201e6f5661b9e41f1492ce39335948/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1232.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1232","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2002-1232.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f0111a41156462d46f484c055bdeafa69cf38c8e/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1232.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/debian_DSA-180.nasl","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d8c03b84658bbca948e09e4af723cb11141fb41e/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-xj67-5prp-p33j/GHSA-xj67-5prp-p33j.json","https://github.com/zercurity/vulnerabilities/blob/8eb5f158d91688a46557263c708774d5f8d3956c/2002/CVE-2002-1232","https://github.com/chihsuan/search-engine/blob/9dcdd3e644469883f53565740f0ba8ff617c5120/Data/0A37464A-9757-4508-9CCB-01C10267C3C5.txt","https://github.com/jdkoftinoff/mb-linux-msli/blob/8adb103e34af9ff1d8d122e9ee2a1808836f0a14/uClinux-dist/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/redhat-RHSA-2002-224.nasl","https://github.com/magicsword-io/Magic-SigExplorer/blob/2c28b91b003429a144a687199ee99ebd26f1a343/Magic-SigExplorer/docs/cve_report.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0056.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0055","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0055.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1227","title":"Linux-PAM 空密码认证绕过权限提升漏洞","description":"Linux PAM（Pluggable Authentication Modules）0.76 版本存在认证绕过漏洞，该版本将已禁用用户的密码视为空密码（null password）处理，导致本地或远程攻击者可通过空密码认证方式绕过账户禁用限制，以被禁用用户的身份获取系统访问权限。该漏洞影响使用 PAM 0.76 的各类 Linux 发行版，攻击者无需任何特殊权限即可利用，可能导致权限提升或未授权访问。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1227"],"sources":["osv"],"published":"2002-10-28T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:58:58.173","remediation":"升级 Linux PAM 库至 0.76-22 或更高版本（Debian 已通过 DSA-177 发布补丁），该版本修复了将禁用用户密码视为空密码的认证逻辑缺陷。如无法立即升级，可在 /etc/shadow 中将禁用账户的密码字段设为 \"!*\" 而非空值，并确保 pam_unix.so 配置中启用 nullok 选项时仅对明确允许的账户生效。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.debian.org/security/2002/dsa-177","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/10405.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5994","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/60bbc98c39201e6f5661b9e41f1492ce39335948/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1227.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1227","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2002-1227.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f0111a41156462d46f484c055bdeafa69cf38c8e/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1227.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d8c03b84658bbca948e09e4af723cb11141fb41e/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-pw86-jwrv-pxmm/GHSA-pw86-jwrv-pxmm.json","https://github.com/jdkoftinoff/mb-linux-msli/blob/8adb103e34af9ff1d8d122e9ee2a1808836f0a14/uClinux-dist/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/debian_DSA-177.nasl","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-1227.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--a59bab93-c8ee-4472-a718-dd295321b693.json","https://github.com/Yuning-J/VulnerabilityClassifier/blob/c0f06c21b73c26b5ee2b75c21a498eb04eada4b5/threatPrediction/cveIDThreatType/cve_idgainpre","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_gainpre.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0055.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0054","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0054.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1226","title":"Heimdal kadmind 和 kdc 服务器远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Heimdal Kerberos 实现 0.5 之前版本中的 kadmind 和 kdc 服务存在未明安全漏洞，远程或本地攻击者无需身份认证即可利用该漏洞完全控制目标系统，获取 root 权限。该漏洞影响 Heimdal 0.5 之前的所有版本，攻击复杂度低，无需用户交互，可导致机密性、完整性和可用性完全丧失，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重。建议升级至 Heimdal 0.5 或更高版本以修复此漏洞。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1226"],"sources":["osv"],"published":"2002-10-28T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:58:58.063","remediation":"将 Heimdal 升级至 0.5 或更高版本。Debian 3.0 (woody) 用户升级至 0.4e-7.woody.4，Debian 2.2 (potato) 用户升级至 0.2l-7.4。如无法立即升级，在防火墙层面限制对 kadmind（端口 749）和 kdc（端口 88）服务的访问，仅允许受信管理网段连接。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=103341355708817&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=103462479621246&w=2","http://www.debian.org/security/2002/dsa-178","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/60bbc98c39201e6f5661b9e41f1492ce39335948/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1226.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1226","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2002-1226.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f0111a41156462d46f484c055bdeafa69cf38c8e/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1226.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d8c03b84658bbca948e09e4af723cb11141fb41e/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-vvvj-29m3-wc9p/GHSA-vvvj-29m3-wc9p.json","https://github.com/zercurity/vulnerabilities/blob/8eb5f158d91688a46557263c708774d5f8d3956c/2002/CVE-2002-1226","https://github.com/jdkoftinoff/mb-linux-msli/blob/8adb103e34af9ff1d8d122e9ee2a1808836f0a14/uClinux-dist/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/debian_DSA-178.nasl","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_149400_149500.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-1226.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x6000/5731/info.html"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0054.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0053","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0053.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1225","title":"Heimdal kadmind 和 kdc 服务器缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Heimdal 0.5 之前版本的 kadmind 和 kdc 服务中存在多处缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过网络向目标服务发送特制的畸形请求触发缓冲区溢出，进而覆盖内存中的关键数据，最终获得目标系统的 root 权限。该漏洞影响所有运行 Heimdal 0.5 之前版本的系统，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1225"],"sources":["osv"],"published":"2002-10-28T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:58:57.947","remediation":"立即将 Heimdal 升级至 0.5 或更高版本。SuSE Linux 用户可通过 rpm -Fhv 安装对应发行版更新包（如 SuSE-8.0 的 heimdal-0.4e-191.i386.rpm），安装后执行 /etc/rc.d/kdc restart 重启服务。Gentoo 用户执行 emerge sync && emerge heimdal。Debian 用户参考 DSA-178 安装更新。如无法立即升级，可在防火墙层面限制对 kadmind（默认端口 464）和 kdc（默认端口 88）的远程访问作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=103341355708817&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=103462479621246&w=2","http://www.debian.org/security/2002/dsa-178","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/10116.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5729","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/60bbc98c39201e6f5661b9e41f1492ce39335948/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1225.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1225","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2002-1225.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f0111a41156462d46f484c055bdeafa69cf38c8e/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1225.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d8c03b84658bbca948e09e4af723cb11141fb41e/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-7gh5-g6w7-v7hq/GHSA-7gh5-g6w7-v7hq.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/debian_DSA-178.nasl","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-1226.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_149400_149500.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--d06264ac-ddc1-4684-a366-0a494e6ab370.json","https://github.com/zercurity/vulnerabilities/blob/8eb5f158d91688a46557263c708774d5f8d3956c/2002/CVE-2002-1226"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0053.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0052","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0052.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1216","title":"GNU tar 符号链接攻击任意文件写入漏洞","description":"GNU tar 1.13.19 及之前版本（1.13.25 之前）存在任意文件写入漏洞。由于安全补丁修改了 tar 的符号链接检查逻辑，导致安全检查被有效禁用，远程攻击者可通过构造恶意的 tar 归档文件，利用符号链接攻击在解压时覆盖目标系统上的任意文件。该漏洞影响 GNU tar 1.13.19 至 1.13.24 版本，攻击者无需身份认证即可远程触发，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1216"],"sources":["osv"],"published":"2002-10-28T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:58:56.860","remediation":"升级 GNU tar 至 1.13.25 或更高版本，该版本重新启用了被禁用的符号链接安全检查。对于 Red Hat 系发行版，安装 RHSA-2002:138 提供的更新包。如无法立即升级，可在解压前手动检查 tar 包中是否包含符号链接文件，避免以 root 权限解压不可信的 tar 包。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=103419290219680&w=2","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/10224.php","http://www.mandriva.com/security/advisories?name=MDKSA-2006:219","http://www.openpkg.com/security/advisories/OpenPKG-SA-2006.038.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-096.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2006/CVE-2006-6097.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/60bbc98c39201e6f5661b9e41f1492ce39335948/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1216.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1216","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2002-1216.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f0111a41156462d46f484c055bdeafa69cf38c8e/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1216.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d8c03b84658bbca948e09e4af723cb11141fb41e/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-29pg-f8vr-x2wh/GHSA-29pg-f8vr-x2wh.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/redhat-RHSA-2002-138.nasl","https://github.com/kees/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/66a43c37da527bc16621fb5548dca8aa1f46e537/retired/CVE-2006-6097","https://github.com/rnxpyke/tiny-thoughts/blob/3d5c9ca3775ee2ad0538a6027948d1539e2174b7/thoughts/filesystem_quirks.md","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_138300_138400.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0052.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0051","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0051.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1215","title":"Linux HA heartbeat 格式化字符串远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Heartbeat 0.4.9 及更早版本中存在多处格式化字符串漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向 UDP 端口 694 发送特制数据包触发该漏洞，导致任意代码执行。该漏洞影响所有运行 Heartbeat 服务的系统，无需身份认证即可远程利用，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重。厂商已发布补丁修复此漏洞，建议用户升级至最新版本。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1215"],"sources":["osv"],"published":"2002-10-28T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:58:56.743","remediation":"升级 heartbeat 至 0.4.9.0l-7.2 或更高版本（Debian 3.0 woody 对应 DSA-174）。如无法升级，在防火墙或 iptables 层面限制外部对 UDP 694 端口的访问，仅允许受信任源 IP 通信。同时禁用 heartbeat 的格式字符串调试功能（如有），并确保 heartbeat 以最小权限用户运行。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000540","http://linux-ha.org/security/sec01.txt","http://www.debian.org/security/2002/dsa-174","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/10357.php","http://www.novell.com/linux/security/advisories/2002_037_heartbeat.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5955","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2002/CVE-2002-1215.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/60bbc98c39201e6f5661b9e41f1492ce39335948/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1215.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1215","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f2c577e1255b2c3fd617b7f1c499a222feb7b668/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1215.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2002/CVE-2002-1215.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d8c03b84658bbca948e09e4af723cb11141fb41e/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-mm3r-mrmx-x8fm/GHSA-mm3r-mrmx-x8fm.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/debian_DSA-174.nasl","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--fe75d298-9773-48c1-9204-2fbd548baecd.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x6000/5955/info.html","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-debian/blob/adb0abfbea757d46e846ba7d3640d43b01b979fe/tracker/DSA/DSA-174.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0051.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0050","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0050.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1200","title":"Balabit Syslog-NG 缓冲区溢出远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Balabit Syslog-NG 1.4.x 1.4.15 之前版本和 1.5.x 1.5.20 之前版本在使用模板文件名或输出时，宏展开过程中遇到常量字符时未正确跟踪缓冲区大小，导致缓冲区溢出漏洞（CWE-119）。远程未认证攻击者可通过发送特制的 syslog 消息触发宏展开时的缓冲区溢出，导致拒绝服务甚至远程代码执行。影响版本包括 Balabit Syslog-NG 1.4.x 1.4.15 之前版本及 1.5.x 1.5.20 之前版本，CVSS 7.5（AV:N/AC:L/Au:N/C:P/I:P/A:P），攻击向量为网络远程利用，无需认证，攻击复杂度低，影响机密性、完整性和可用性。Balabit 已在 1.4.15 和 1.5.20 版本中修复该漏洞，建议升级至修复版本。Debian DSA-175 等发行版也发布了相应安全更新。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1200"],"sources":["osv"],"published":"2002-10-28T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:58:55.507","remediation":"将 syslog-ng 升级至 1.4.15（1.4.x 系列）或 1.5.20（1.5.x 系列）及以上版本。Debian 用户可通过 apt-get install syslog-ng 更新至 DSA-175 修复版本。如无法立即升级，可在 syslog-ng.conf 中禁用模板文件名（template filenames）和模板输出（template output）功能，避免使用宏展开（macro expansion）作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000547","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=103426595021928&w=2","http://www.balabit.hu/static/zsa/ZSA-2002-014-en.txt","http://www.debian.org/security/2002/dsa-175","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/10339.php","http://www.linuxsecurity.com/advisories/other_advisory-2513.html","http://www.novell.com/linux/security/advisories/2002_039_syslog_ng.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5934","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2002/CVE-2002-1200.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/60bbc98c39201e6f5661b9e41f1492ce39335948/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1200.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1200","https://github.com/anchore/nvd-data-overrides/blob/280b44dba3ccda95bef6ae4930447a6bec9136f3/data/2002/CVE-2002-1200.json","https://github.com/edoardottt/missing-cve-nuclei-templates/blob/115c94bd1da3cc18977d652d6e78c9f4a5dfc13b/data/year/2002.txt","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d8c03b84658bbca948e09e4af723cb11141fb41e/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-rjhm-8rqf-6wp8/GHSA-rjhm-8rqf-6wp8.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/debian_DSA-175.nasl","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x6000/5934/info.html","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Exploit-List-Ja/blob/b82432e7d59d95db9f183c0cefa7744595784afa/2002.tsv","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--82edbceb-bbdf-4dd1-b78b-7f6cebc0a5b0.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0050.toml"}]